<view class="hg-page hg-club">
  <hg-nav title="社团名片" />

  <block wx:if="{{ loading }}">
    <view class="hg-club__loading">
      <view class="hg-club__skeleton hg-club__skeleton--hero"></view>
      <view class="hg-club__skeleton hg-club__skeleton--line"></view>
      <view class="hg-club__skeleton hg-club__skeleton--line hg-club__skeleton--short"></view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:elif="{{ loadError }}">
    <empty-state
      icon="error-circle"
      title="暂时读不到社团资料"
      desc="{{ loadError }}"
      action="再试一次"
      bind:action="onRetry"
    />
  </block>

  <empty-state
    wx:elif="{{ !club }}"
    icon="usergroup"
    title="社团资料暂未开放"
    desc="等资料准备好后，这里会介绍社团与近期公告。"
    action="再试一次"
    bind:action="onRetry"
  />

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="hg-club__hero">
      <view class="hg-club__emblem" aria-label="{{ club.name }}社徽">黑</view>
      <view class="hg-club__hero-main">
        <view class="hg-club__name">{{ club.name }}</view>
        <view class="hg-club__slogan">{{ club.slogan }}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="hg-club__intro">{{ club.intro }}</view>

    <view class="hg-club__section-title">近期公告与活动</view>
    <view class="hg-club__empty-event">
      <t-icon name="calendar" size="38rpx" />
      <view class="hg-club__empty-event-main">
        <view class="hg-club__empty-event-title">这里还没有新的公告</view>
        <view class="hg-club__empty-event-desc"
          >有活动时会在这里说明时间和地点。不会收集报名名单，也不会锁定名额。</view
        >
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="hg-club__section-title">社区约定</view>
    <view class="hg-club__rules" bindtap="onRulesTap" aria-role="button">
      <view class="hg-club__rules-main">
        <view class="hg-club__rules-title">一起把这里留给每一种表达</view>
        <view class="hg-club__rules-desc"
          >当前版本 {{ club.rulesVersion || 'v1.1' }} · 社团约定、平台要求与法律义务分层说明</view
        >
      </view>
      <t-icon name="chevron-right" size="34rpx" />
    </view>

    <view class="hg-club__membership">
      <view class="hg-club__membership-icon">
        <t-icon name="{{ memberStatus === 'active' ? 'check-circle' : 'usergroup-add' }}" size="40rpx" />
      </view>
      <view class="hg-club__membership-main">
        <view class="hg-club__membership-title">{{ memberStatusText.title }}</view>
        <view class="hg-club__membership-desc">{{ memberStatusText.desc }}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{ applicationReason }}" class="hg-club__membership-reason">{{ applicationReason }}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{ memberStatus !== 'active' }}" class="hg-club__join" bindtap="onJoinTap" aria-role="button">
      {{ memberStatusText.action || '申请加入' }}
    </view>

    <view class="hg-club__footnote">
      访客只能看到公开的社团介绍。成员名册、联系方式与社内活动细节不会出现在这里。
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
